---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Container from "../components/ui/Container.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of Service for A K Studio. Please read these terms carefully before booking our services."
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <Container>
      <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose dark:prose-invert prose-headings:font-semibold prose-headings:tracking-tight">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-mute dark:text-[#666666] mb-4">Legal</p>
        <h1>Terms of Service.</h1>
        <p class="text-body dark:text-[#a1a1a1]">Last updated: January 2025</p>

        <h2>Booking & Payment</h2>
        <p>
          A 25% booking fee is required to secure your date. The remaining balance is due 14 days before the event. All prices are in INR and include applicable taxes.
        </p>

        <h2>Cancellation Policy</h2>
        <p>
          If you need to cancel, please notify us as early as possible. The booking fee is non-refundable but may be transferred to a new date subject to availability.
        </p>

        <h2>Delivery Timeline</h2>
        <p>
          Edited photos are delivered within 4–6 weeks of the wedding. Wedding films are delivered within 8–12 weeks. A sneak peek of 20–30 photos is shared within 48 hours.
        </p>

        <h2>Client Conduct</h2>
        <p>
          We strive to provide the best possible service. However, we reserve the right to terminate coverage if we experience unsafe conditions or unreasonable behavior that affects our ability to deliver.
        </p>

        <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          While we take every precaution, in the unlikely event of equipment failure or technical issues, our liability is limited to a full refund of fees paid. We recommend couples consider wedding insurance for additional coverage.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions about these terms, please email us at <a href="mailto:hello@akreation.in">hello@akreation.in</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
